      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006205,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 5,
      "SpeakerName": "大黑",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "一直到小学中年级，我都住在东北。/n从小我就不太喜欢在外面活动身体。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20062050040",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "202"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006205006,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006205,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 6,
      "SpeakerName": "大黑",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "那时候虽然也不算懂，倒是种过小番茄，/n还迷上了园艺。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20062050050",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "202"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006205007,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006205,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "SpeakerName": "大黑",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "浇浇水，看它一点点长大。/n我很喜欢那种悠闲的时间。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20062050060",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "202"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006205008,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006205,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 8,
      "SpeakerName": "大黑",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "就是那个时候，那恶魔出现在了我面前……！",
      "VoiceFileName": "20062050070",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "202"
    },
    {
